      "excerpt": "PROSPECTUS SUMMARY 1 SUMMARY CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL AND OPERATING DATA 12 RISK FACTORS 13 SPECIAL NOTE REGARDING FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS 36 USE OF PROCEEDS 37 DIVIDEND POLICY 38 CAPITALIZATION 39 DILUTION 40 ENFORCEABILITY OF CIVIL LIABILITIES 41 CORPORATE HISTORY AND STRUCTURE 43 MANAGEMENT\u2019S DISCUSSION AND ANALYSIS OF FINANCIAL CONDITION AND  RESULTS OF OPERATIONS 44 OUR INDUSTRY 55 OUR BUSINESS 65 REGULATIONS 73 MANAGEMENT 78 PRINCIPAL SHAREHOLDERS 81 SELLING SHAREHOLDERS 83 RELATED PARTY TRANSACTIONS 85 DESCRIPTION OF SHARE CAPITAL 86 PLAN OF DISTRIBUTION 95 SHARES ELIGIBLE FOR FUTURE SALE 98 TAXATION 100 EXPENSES RELATING TO THIS OFFERING 105 LEGAL MATTERS 106 EXPERTS 106 WHERE YOU CAN FIND ADDITIONAL INFORMATION 106 INDEX TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS F-1 You should rely only on the information contained in this prospectus or in any related free writing prospectus. Neithe",
